  + [source_manifest_uuid] is ce518e72-09de-461d-a76e-63e5d2bcbff8
  + [authority_scope] is P5 runtime implementation activation slice order, activation boundary, exact file inventory, graph state and checkpoint model refresh, deterministic transition model, interrupt handoff model, generated trace path policy, fixture runner contract, validation tests, generated trace nonpromotion, no-dispatch proof, no-operations-control proof, no-live-effect proof, dependency deferral, adapter deferral, dispatch deferral, live-control deferral, proof pack, and downstream readiness rebake
