  + [P5-IA02] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P5-IA03] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P5-IA04] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after P5-IA03 acceptance
  + [P5-IA05] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [P5-IA06] is requires deeper reasoning

  = must: keep activation boundary, exact file inventory, checkpoint model, interrupt model, generated trace path policy, dependency decisions, adapter decisions, dispatch boundaries, operations boundaries, proof-pack closure, and live-control boundaries under deeper reasoning
  = must: treat bounded validation tests, generated trace nonpromotion proof, no-dispatch proof, no-operations-control proof, and no-live-effect proof as Spark-suitable only after upstream activation gates are accepted

